  "en": "<div style=\"text-align:left;max-width:720px;margin:0 auto;color:#28272a\">\n<div style=\"padding:6px 0 20px;text-align:left\">\n<h2 style=\"font-size:23px;line-height:1.35;color:#28272a;margin:0\"><strong>Soft, Even Pearlescent Glow</strong></h2>\n<p style=\"margin:10px 0 0;color:#4a4446;font-size:13.5px;line-height:2\">A set pairing Marshmallow Body Highlighter with a makeup brush for a soft, pearlescent shimmer that reflects light without changing the skin’s natural tone. The creamy formula blends easily, with buildable luminosity.</p>\n</div>\n<div style=\"height:1px;background:rgba(94, 46, 33, 0.15);margin:0\"> </div>\n<details style=\"padding:4px 0;text-align:left\">\n<summary style=\"display:flex;padding:16px 0;font-size:17px;color:#28272a\"><strong>What’s Included</strong><span style=\"margin-left:auto;font-size:20px;color:#5e2e21;line-height:1\">+</span></summary>\n<div style=\"padding:0 0 18px\">\n<div style=\"background:#ffffff;border-radius:16px;padding:16px 18px;margin-top:10px;text-align:left\">\n<h4 style=\"font-size:15.5px;color:#28272a;margin:0\"><strong>Marshmallow Body Highlighter | 30 ml</strong></h4>\n<p style=\"margin:6px 0 0;color:#4a4446;font-size:13.5px;line-height:1.9\">A creamy highlighter with a soft pearlescent shimmer, featuring shea and cocoa butters to help keep skin moisturized and soft.</p>\n</div>\n<div style=\"background:#ffffff;border-radius:16px;padding:16px 18px;margin-top:10px;text-align:left\">\n<h4 style=\"font-size:15.5px;color:#28272a;margin:0\"><strong>Makeup Brush</strong></h4>\n<p style=\"margin:6px 0 0;color:#4a4446;font-size:13.5px;line-height:1.9\">A soft, dense-bristled brush that helps distribute and blend the highlighter evenly for a smooth finish.</p>\n</div>\n</div>\n</details>\n<div style=\"height:1px;background:rgba(94, 46, 33, 0.35);margin:0\"> </div>\n<details style=\"padding:4px 0;text-align:left\">\n<summary style=\"display:flex;padding:16px 0;font-size:17px;color:#28272a\"><strong>How to Use</strong><span style=\"margin-left:auto;font-size:20px;color:#5e2e21;line-height:1\">+</span></summary>\n<div style=\"padding:0 0 18px\">\n<div style=\"margin-top:6px\">\n<div style=\"padding:10px 0\">\n<p style=\"margin:0;color:#4a4446;font-size:13.5px;line-height:1.9\">Apply after dressing to clean, dry skin. Glide the highlighter over the desired areas and blend thoroughly with the makeup brush. Allow the product to dry and set on the skin.</p>\n</div>\n<div style=\"height:1px;background:rgba(94, 46, 33, 0.12);margin:0\"> </div>\n<div style=\"padding:10px 0\">\n<p style=\"margin:0;color:#4a4446;font-size:13.5px;line-height:1.9\">Removal: Wash off with soap and water.</p>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</details>\n<div style=\"height:1px;background:rgba(94, 46, 33, 0.35);margin:0\"> </div>\n<details style=\"padding:4px 0;text-align:left\">\n<summary style=\"display:flex;padding:16px 0;font-size:17px;color:#28272a\"><strong>Key Ingredients</strong><span style=\"margin-left:auto;font-size:20px;color:#5e2e21;line-height:1\">+</span></summary>\n<div style=\"padding:0 0 18px\">\n<div style=\"background:#ffffff;border-radius:16px;padding:14px 18px;margin-top:10px\">\n<p style=\"margin:8px 0 0;color:#4a4446;font-size:13.5px;line-height:1.9\">Shea butter, cocoa butter, shimmer particles.</p>\n</div>\n</div>\n</details>\n<div style=\"height:1px;background:rgba(94, 46, 33, 0.35);margin:0\"> </div>\n<div style=\"padding:22px 0 8px;text-align:left\"><span style=\"display:inline-block;background:#EAE2D9;color:#5e2e21;border-radius:999px;padding:6px 14px;margin:4px;font-size:13px\"><strong>Set includes: Marshmallow Body Highlighter 30 ml + Makeup Brush.</strong></span></div>\n</div>"
